prefix: mcp
title: scry over MCP
---
[root] scry over MCP (complete)
The MCP delivery is complete for the singleton add API; this graph now carries the set-upsert process boundary after the library set checkpoint. A separate human-facing command remains unplanned.
Each node records the boundary it owns and the check that made it true.
This graph ends at process-level MCP validation. VS Code host registration and Chat invocation are separate lifecycle stages documented in lifecycle.md.
The cross-file order is deliberate: library.vine set-checkpoint must complete before set-mcp-adapter starts, and this graph records that gate in the affected node descriptions.
-> e2e
-> set-mcp-checkpoint
