[set-mcp-checkpoint] Judge the batch MCP stage (complete)
Validate the MCP set stage after the library set checkpoint.
Files: the existing MCP validation commands and delivery record.
Do: run workspace tests, formatting, clippy, docs, and cargo-deny; review schema, adapter mapping, process evidence, and the cross-stage library dependency together.
Accept: the process exposes exactly the library set contract, all report states have executable or focused mapping evidence, and the stage is ready for host-level registration without new protocol semantics.
-> set-mcp-adapter
-> set-mcp-contract
-> set-mcp-e2e
> Completed on 2026-08-29 after library.vine set-checkpoint. Final workspace validation passed: cargo test --workspace --all-targets reported 133 library unit tests, 15 library integration tests, 2 MCP mapper tests, and 1 MCP process test; cargo fmt --all -- --check, cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings, cargo doc --workspace --no-deps, and cargo deny check all passed. Cargo-deny retained only the existing duplicate-version warnings and reported advisories, bans, licenses, and sources OK.
> The MCP adapter remains synchronous, uses the minimal supported Store facade, and publishes no new protocol or cancellation machinery. Host registration and Chat invocation remain outside this process checkpoint.
